        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Add the information included in <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43599#issuecomment-4150881552\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/43599/hovercard\">feedback</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43599#top\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/43599/hovercard\">‎browser_specific_settings version dot releases rejected by AMO</a> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4154091716\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43599\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/43599/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43599\">#43599</a> regarding the effect of March 2025 certificate expiration on practical values for strict minimum versions.</li>\n<li>Moved the reference to the list of supported gecko versions under <code class=\"notranslate\">gecko.strict_max_version</code> to make it more visible.</li>\n</ol>",
