            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137640490?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Added data_collection_permissions with required: [\"none\"]<br>\nUpdated strict_min_version to \"140.0\"</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">makes reader to view in updated version environment</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n <span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #43574.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4135876162\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43574\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43574/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43574\">#43574</a>\n\n\n",
