            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This is in progress work to provide a list of all reports and how they are accessed for reporting API.<br>\n<span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #43688.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4217377323\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43688\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43688/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43688\">#43688</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This will have the parent grouping. Still working on the pages that it needs before this can go in though. This is all being tested still.</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Document-Policy violations <a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/document-policy/#configure-reporting\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wicg.github.io/document-policy/#configure-reporting</a> and <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5756689661820928\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5756689661820928</a> and <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1670887977\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/394\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/mdn/issues/394/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/394\">mdn/mdn#394</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/WICG/document-policy/blob/main/document-policy-explainer.md\">https://github.com/WICG/document-policy/blob/main/document-policy-explainer.md</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Permission policy violations - to be done <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-permissions-policy/#permissionspolicyviolationreportbody\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-permissions-policy/#permissionspolicyviolationreportbody</a> - chrome OR</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Network errors - to be done - see <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/network-error-logging/#concept-network-error-reports\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/network-error-logging/#concept-network-error-reports</a> <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/network-error-logging/#nel-response-header\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/network-error-logging/#nel-response-header</a> <a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Guides/Network_Error_Logging\">Network Error Logging</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Crash reports - to be done - <a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/crash-reporting/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wicg.github.io/crash-reporting/</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> coop to be done - (<a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#coop-reporting\" rel=\"nofollow\">spec</a>)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> csp-next - <a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/csp-next/scripting-policy.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wicg.github.io/csp-next/scripting-policy.html</a> - appears dormant and not implementd</li>\n</ul>",
