        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome removed the need to enable the developer tools to use the userScript API in Chrome 148.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See <a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/390138269\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.chromium.org/issues/390138269</a>, which was fixed by <a href=\"https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/7692015\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/7692015</a>.<br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/7352080/576750809-0bc332b3-74ef-4c41-acc6-5b736b6f12a4.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..8gW713hNqzjiTTsAM7DMg4l6WFisCEeZTryT9XaVgb8\"><img width=\"1415\" height=\"241\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/7352080/576750809-0bc332b3-74ef-4c41-acc6-5b736b6f12a4.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..8gW713hNqzjiTTsAM7DMg4l6WFisCEeZTryT9XaVgb8\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 241px;\"></a></p>",
